# Big Green 01 and the other teams' karts (c_lp_kart*, c_luigi_kart; ART_PLAN wave 3 row 1). The kart itself is the style
# model's (art/tools/cut_kart.py, kart_cards.py: the shell, seat, wheels, wheel and engine cut from its design and Qwen's
# pieces, in every team's paint, and wrecked); only the game's effects are made here: the backfire (the Lava Bubble's
# flame), the exhaust puff and the wreck's smoke (effect.tpl's cloud). Numbers: sl_models.py cards c_lp_kart

# ---- c_lp_kart
image art/models/c_lp_kart/3.png   # flame 0
  canvas 72 56
  piece f model c_bubble 17
  @f rotate 90
  @f scale 64 48 texel
  paste f 4 4
  alpha cut 128
end

image art/models/c_lp_kart/13.png   # puff 0
  load tpl e/us/effect.tpl 12
  alpha set 0 where l<60
  fill where a>=128 #d8d4cc
  scale 48 40 texel
  alpha cut 128
end

image art/models/c_lp_kart/14.png   # smoke_1 0
  load tpl e/us/effect.tpl 12
  alpha set 0 where l<60
  fill where a>=128 #a8a098
  scale 80 72 texel
  alpha cut 128
end

image art/models/c_lp_kart/15.png   # smoke_2 0
  load tpl e/us/effect.tpl 12
  alpha set 0 where l<60
  fill where a>=128 #a8a098
  scale 80 72 texel
  alpha cut 128
end

